\]
\[
0.647 = 5.03 \times \frac{12.432}{M}
\]
\[
M = \frac{5.03 \times 12.432}{0.647} = 97.5 \, \text{g/mol}
\]

Thus, the molecular weight of the unknown solute is \(\boxed{97.5 \, \text{g/mol}}\).",fluency,"# Task Description
