\]
Here, the complex `[Pt(NH3)4Cl2]Cl2` dissociates into `[Pt(NH3)4Cl2]^{2+}$ and two chloride ions (`Cl^-`). Therefore, the number of chloride ions produced is \(\boxed{2}\).
