= 2(2N(x/4)) + 1 = 4N(x/4) + 2 + 1 \\
= 4(2N(x/8)) + 2 + 2 + 1 = 8N(x/8) + 4 + 2 + 1 \\
= 8(2N(x/16)) + 4 + 2 + 2 + 1 = 16N(x/16) + 8 + 4 + 2 + 1
\]

Continuing this pattern, we find:

\[
