   \]

2. **Calculate the cross-sectional area of the tubing**:
   \[
   A = \pi r^2 = \pi \left(\frac{0.1 \text{ mm}}{2}\right)^2 = \pi \left(\frac{0.00005 \text{ m}}{2}\right)^2 = 1.57 \times 10^{-7} \text{ m}^2
   \]

3. **Calculate the flow velocity**:
   \[
   v = \frac{Q}{A} = \frac{1.67 \times 10^{-7} \text{ m}^3 \text{ s}^{-1}}{1.57 \times 10^{-7} \text{ m}^2} = 1.06 \text{ m/s}
   \]

