   \[
   \dot{m} = \dot{\rho} \cdot A_{\text{in}} \cdot v_{\text{in}}
   \]
   where \( \dot{\rho} \) is the density of air, \( A_{\text{in}} \) is the cross-sectional area at the inlet, and \( v_{\text{in}} \) is the inlet velocity.

